    "project": "Csv",
    "summary": "CSVFormat#withHeader doesn't work with CSVPrinter",
    "description": "In the current version \nCSVFormat#withHeader\nis only used by CSVParser. It would be nice if CSVPrinter also supported it. Ideally, the following line of code\n\nCSVPrinter csvPrinter\n= CSVFormat.TDF\n.withHeader(\n\"x\"\n)\n.print(Files.newBufferedWriter(Paths.get(\n\"data.csv\"\n)));\ncsvPrinter.printRecord(42);\ncsvPrinter.close();\n\nshould produce\n\nx\n42\n\nIf you're alright with the idea of automatically inserting headers, I can attach a patch."
